window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Following his abduction from a remote campsite, Daniel Wells escapes his captor and flees into the night. At six years old, he is suddenly cast into a world where nothing is familiar and everything in the Salmon-Challis National Forest, from mountain lions and bears to hungry packs of wolves, views him as easy prey.<br> <br> Just as he begins to think that all hope is lost, to his amazement, an unlikely ally emerges from the frigid darkness, offering him refuge, friendship, and so much more.</p>"; 
